# The image is built from ui/ and backend/ only (see Containerfile). Everything
# else stays out of the build context: .git, the dev daemon's downloads under
# scripts/, coverage reports.
*
!ui
!backend

# Build output and host installs. node_modules from a macOS host would land on
# top of the image's own install and bring the wrong native binaries.
**/node_modules
ui/dist
ui/coverage
ui/test-results
ui/playwright-report
backend/dist
